    <string name="ubuntu_damaged_body">Files the terminal needs are missing from the installed system, for example after an interrupted package update. Nothing has been changed or deleted.\n\nYou can reinstall the system files. Your home directory (/home) is moved into the new system unchanged. Everything else (installed packages, /etc, /root, /opt) is replaced.\n\nView the logs for details.</string>
